// Syncthing ignore patterns for the myak database directory.
// Copy to ~/.claude/memory/.stignore (the synced folder) and adapt.
//
// SQLite journal/WAL side files must never be synced: they are only valid
// together with the exact database file on the machine that wrote them.
*-journal
*-wal
*-shm
//
// NOT ignored on purpose: *.sync-conflict-* files. If Syncthing reports a
// conflict for memory.db, look at the conflict copy before deleting it; it may
// contain sessions indexed on the other machine.
//
// Machine-local data does NOT live in this folder and is never synced:
// ~/.claude/myak-state/ holds state.db, backups/, the hook launcher (bin/) and
// the recorded interpreter (venv-python). Do not add it to the synced folder.
